* Transistor-Level Subcircuit for LM741 OpAmp (Texas Instruments Internal Schematic)
* Nodes: IN+ IN- VCC VEE OUT
.subckt LM741_BJT 3 2 7 4 6
* 3: IN+ (non-inverting)
* 2: IN- (inverting)
* 7: VCC (+15V)
* 4: VEE (-15V)
* 6: OUT

* Standard BJT models for IC fabrication (typical monolithic bipolar process)
.model QNPN NPN(Is=1e-14 Bf=200 Vaf=100 Cjc=2p Cje=3p Tf=0.3n)
.model QPNP PNP(Is=1e-14 Bf=50 Vaf=50 Cjc=3p Cje=4p Tf=1n)
.model QSUB PNP(Is=1e-14 Bf=20 Vaf=30)

* --- Input Stage ---
* Q1, Q2: NPN emitter followers
Q1 7 3 11 QNPN
Q2 7 2 12 QNPN

* Q3, Q4: Lateral PNP common-base differential stage
Q3 13 15 11 QPNP
Q4 14 15 12 QPNP

* Q5, Q6: Active load current mirror with degeneration
Q5 13 13 16 QNPN
Q6 14 13 17 QNPN
R1 16 4 1k
R2 17 4 1k

* Q7: Current mirror feedback
Q7 7 13 4 QNPN

* Bias current source for input stage (Q8, Q9)
Q8 7 18 15 QPNP
Q9 18 18 7 QPNP
R3 18 4 39k

* Widlar current source for input stage base bias
Q10 15 19 4 QNPN
Q11 19 19 4 QNPN
R4 19 4 5k
R5 7 19 39k

* --- Intermediate Gain Stage ---
* Q16 (Darlington driver) and Q17 (high gain amplifier)
Q16 7 14 20 QNPN
Q17 21 20 22 QNPN
R8 22 4 100
R9 20 4 50k

* Current source load for gain stage (Q12, Q13)
Q12 7 18 23 QPNP
Q13 21 18 7 QPNP

* Miller Compensation Capacitor
Cc 14 21 30p

* --- Output Stage ---
* Q18, Q19: Vbe multiplier (Class AB biasing)
Q18 21 24 25 QNPN
Q19 24 24 25 QNPN
R10 21 24 40k
R11 25 4 50k

* Q14 (NPN upper output) and Q20 (PNP lower output)
Q14 7 21 26 QNPN
Q20 4 25 27 QPNP
R6 26 6 27
R7 27 6 22

* Current limiting protection transistors
Q15 7 26 21 QNPN
Q21 4 27 25 QPNP

.ends LM741_BJT
